{"id":"e62e9105378d9d51","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-gls-not-normal.md","title":"GLS Is Not Closed under Necessitation","display":"prop-gls-not-normal — GLS Is Not Closed under Necessitation","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-gls-not-normal","aliases":["89-prop-gls-not-normal"],"display":"prop-gls-not-normal — GLS Is Not Closed under Necessitation","depends_on":["[[89-df-gls-logic]]","[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","[[89-thm-gls-completeness]]","[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-gls-not-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-gls-not-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-gls-not-normal — GLS Is Not Closed under Necessitation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da4d48b529c5f7d2\" href=\"?note=da4d48b529c5f7d2\" title=\"89-df-gls-logic\">89-df-gls-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e926c452321080c\" href=\"?note=9e926c452321080c\" title=\"89-thm-gls-completeness\">89-thm-gls-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\Box\\bot\\to\\bot\">\\(C=\\Box\\bot\\to\\bot\\)</span> 是反射实例。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLS}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLS}\\)</span> 为 MP 闭包反射逻辑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span> 为已有正规性谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gls\\text{-}not\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\nC\\in\\mathrm{GLS},\\qquad\n\\Box C\\notin\\mathrm{GLS},\\qquad\n\\neg\\mathrm{Normal}(\\mathrm{GLS}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gls\\text{-}not\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\nC\\in\\mathrm{GLS},\\qquad\n\\Box C\\notin\\mathrm{GLS},\\qquad\n\\neg\\mathrm{Normal}(\\mathrm{GLS}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 3 章，印刷页 65–66；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\">\\(\\Box C\\)</span> 属 GLS，则 GL 的 Löb 实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box\\bot\\to\\bot)\\to\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\Box(\\Box\\bot\\to\\bot)\\to\\Box\\bot\\)</span> 与 MP 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\Box\\bot\\)</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>。但 GLS 算术可靠性排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\">\\(\\Box C\\)</span> 不属于 GLS。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gls-logic","status":"resolved","id":"da4d48b529c5f7d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gls-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gls-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"9e926c452321080c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gls-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\Box\\bot\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gls\\text{-}not\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\nC\\in\\mathrm{GLS},\\qquad\n\\Box C\\notin\\mathrm{GLS},\\qquad\n\\neg\\mathrm{Normal}(\\mathrm{GLS}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box\\bot\\to\\bot)\\to\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C","display":false}],"bytes":1174,"backlinks":[{"id":"da4d48b529c5f7d2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 3 章，印刷页 65–66；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n包含所有 GL 定理和所有反射实例，唯一推理规则为 MP。定义族非空（全部公式集在其中），交集即有限 MP 闭包。加入必然化会使反射与 Löb 共同推出矛盾，见 [[89-prop-gls-not-normal]]。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-553","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-prop-gls-not-normal]]"}],"outgoing":["da4d48b529c5f7d2","491579297d817026","9e926c452321080c","bdef52f3ff411531"]}